        <footnote id="F5">On February 13, 2023, the Reporting Person was granted 190,588 RSUs vesting quarterly over four (4) years from March 1, 2023. On April 28, 2023, the vesting terms of 14,119 of such RSUs were amended to provide for vesting in equal monthly installments over one (1) year from April 23, 2023. Accordingly, such 14,119 RSUs are no longer included in the Reporting Person's holdings with respect to the February 13, 2023 grant of 190,588 RSUs.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">On February 12, 2024, the Reporting Person was granted 77,196 RSUs vesting quarterly over four (4) years from March 1, 2024.</footnote>
